[NAME]
noports \- NoPorts CLI for atSign activation and key issuance
[EXAMPLES]
.nf
noports activate '@alice:cram:secret123'
noports issue-keys -a @alice
.fi
[SEE ALSO]
at_activate(1), sshnp(1), sshnpd(1)
.PP
Full documentation at <https://docs.noports.com/>
[REPORTING BUGS]
Report bugs at <https://github.com/atsign-foundation/noports/issues>
